# Normalize line endings to LF for everything text-ish, regardless of a
# contributor's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, checkouts on
# Windows (or any local `core.autocrlf=true`) rewrite every file's line
# endings, which then shows up as spurious churn or as noisy "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF" warnings on every git operation.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/generated assets: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
